# A recipe's steps, checked (tools/make_manual.py --renders; nothing to see or hear: the expects are the point): from P1, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time about 2 s.
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 27
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 2500
wait 1500
tapkey w4
wait 4000
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 4000
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 4000
